  "description": "A C#/.NET port of the official Uniswap SDK monorepo (Uniswap/sdks): sdk-core, v2/v3/v4-sdk, router-sdk, universal-router-sdk, uniswapx-sdk, permit2-sdk and smart-wallet-sdk. Model tokens, pools, positions, routes and trades; run the tick/sqrt-price/swap/liquidity math; build V3/V4 periphery and Universal Router calldata; and hash/sign Permit2 and UniswapX orders — all with exact BigInteger/BigRational arithmetic (no floating point in protocol math).",
